Phase 4 – Attendance Module
Objective

Build the complete production-grade attendance workflow (Check-In & Check-Out)
with GPS geofencing, anti-spoofing, live selfie capture, and daily state machine.

─────────────────────────────────────────
4.1 Location Service (locationService.ts)
─────────────────────────────────────────

Tasks

  GPS Fetching
  - getCurrentPosition() with enableHighAccuracy: true
  - timeout: 15000ms, maximumAge: 30000ms
  - Reject fix if accuracy > 50 meters
  - Return: latitude, longitude, accuracy, timestamp

  Haversine Distance Calculator
  - calculateDistance(lat1, lon1, lat2, lon2): number
  - Result in meters, uses Earth radius 6371000m
  - Used to compare distance with school geofence radius

  Mock / Fake GPS Detection
  - Android: check Location.isFromMockProvider flag
  - iOS: check isSimulatedLocation flag
  - Return isMockLocation: boolean

  Location Permission Handler
  - checkLocationPermission(): 'granted' | 'denied' | 'never_ask_again'
  - requestLocationPermission()
  - openDeviceLocationSettings() (deep link)

  School Coordinates Caching
  - Fetch school anchor (lat, lon, radius) from backend API on session start
  - Cache locally with MMKV for 24 hours
  - Use cached value if network is unavailable

─────────────────────────────────────────
4.2 Attendance Redux State (attendanceSlice.ts)
─────────────────────────────────────────

Tasks

  Daily State Machine
  - todayStatus: 'NOT_CHECKED_IN' | 'CHECKED_IN' | 'CHECKED_OUT'
  - Reset to NOT_CHECKED_IN at midnight (via app focus listener)

  Location State
  - currentLat, currentLon, currentAccuracy
  - isInsideGeofence: boolean
  - geofenceDistanceMeters: number
  - isMockLocationDetected: boolean

  Attendance Records
  - checkInTime: string | null
  - checkOutTime: string | null
  - workingHours: string | null
  - isLateCheckIn: boolean
  - isEarlyCheckOut: boolean

  Loading / Error States
  - loading: boolean
  - error: string | null

─────────────────────────────────────────
4.3 Attendance API Service (attendanceService.ts)
─────────────────────────────────────────

Tasks

  fetchTodayStatus(employeeId)
  - Fetches current daily check-in/out status from server
  - Called on app foreground, dashboard mount

  submitAttendance(payload)
  - Multipart upload: selfie image + JSON fields
  - Fields: employeeId, type, latitude, longitude, accuracy,
    deviceTimestamp, deviceId, appVersion
  - Returns: status, checkInTime / checkOutTime, workingHours, lateFlag

  fetchSchoolConfig()
  - Returns: schoolName, anchorLat, anchorLon, geofenceRadius,
    shiftStartTime, shiftEndTime, graceMinutes

─────────────────────────────────────────
4.4 Pre-Flight Permission & Status Checks
─────────────────────────────────────────

Tasks

  checkInternetConnectivity()
  - Uses @react-native-community/netinfo
  - Returns: isConnected: boolean

  checkGPSEnabled()
  - Checks system-level GPS service status
  - Returns: isEnabled: boolean

  checkCameraPermission()
  - Returns: 'granted' | 'denied' | 'never_ask_again'

  checkLocationPermission()
  - Returns: 'granted' | 'denied' | 'never_ask_again'

  All 4 checks run in parallel before any attendance action
  UI shows real-time status card for each check

─────────────────────────────────────────
4.5 Screens
─────────────────────────────────────────

  AttendanceHomeScreen
  - 4-card pre-flight status display (Internet, GPS, Camera, Location)
  - Real-time GPS distance to school with live green/red indicator
  - Dynamic type selector: Check-In | Check-Out (based on daily state)
  - Proceed button disabled if any check fails
  - "Attendance Completed Today" state when fully done

  AttendanceCameraScreen
  - Real front camera using react-native-vision-camera
  - Gallery picker completely disabled (takePhoto only)
  - Face alignment oval overlay
  - Flash toggle
  - Auto-capture option hint

  AttendancePreviewScreen
  - Captured selfie full preview
  - Watermark overlay: School Name | Date & Time | Lat/Lon
  - Confirm button triggers API submission with loading overlay
  - Retake button goes back to camera

  AttendanceSuccessScreen
  - Animated green tick (Lottie or native animation)
  - Check-In Time displayed (or Check-Out Time)
  - Total Working Hours displayed (for check-out)
  - Late flag badge shown if applicable
  - Back to Dashboard button

  AttendanceFailedScreen
  - Error type enum displayed with specific message:
    OUTSIDE_GEOFENCE | MOCK_GPS | NO_INTERNET | LOW_ACCURACY
    CAMERA_DENIED | ALREADY_DONE | SERVER_ERROR
  - Contextual action buttons:
    "Enable GPS" | "Open Settings" | "Retry" | "Back"

─────────────────────────────────────────
4.6 Components
─────────────────────────────────────────

  PermissionStatusCard
  - Single card component showing icon, label, and status
  - States: checking | passed | failed | requesting

  GeofenceStatusBadge
  - Shows real-time distance with green (inside) / red (outside) color
  - Animated pulse dot when inside geofence

  CameraPreview
  - Vision Camera device component with front camera preset
  - Face oval overlay, corner markers

  CaptureButton
  - Large shutter outer ring + inner fill circle
  - Disabled state when location not verified

  SelfiePreviewCard
  - Full image with watermark overlay
  - Date, time, GPS coords, school name

  LoadingOverlay
  - Full-screen overlay with spinner during API submission

  SuccessAnimation
  - Animated green checkmark on success screen

─────────────────────────────────────────
4.7 Edge Cases & Error Handling
─────────────────────────────────────────

  GPS accuracy degrades mid-flow
  - Re-fetch location before submission

  Network drops during selfie upload
  - Show retry option, do NOT auto-submit without user action

  Mock location toggled mid-flow
  - Detect on submission, hard block with error

  Already checked in (server conflict)
  - Handle 409 from server, show ALREADY_CHECKED_IN screen

  User kills app mid-flow
  - State is not committed until server returns success
  - No partial/orphaned records created

